            <ArticleTitle>Effect of adjunctive treatment with tirofiban on troponin T elevation during stenting of critically stenosed aortocoronary saphenous vein grafts.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>681-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In this pilot study, we show that periprocedural administration of tirofiban during stenting of critically stenosed saphenous vein grafts, significantly reduces the occurrence of postprocedural minor myocardial necroses.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
